<title>UK: BBV unit sets $200 mln subordinated 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BBV unit sets $200 mln subordinated 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BBV INTERNATIONAL FINANCE LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANCO BILBAO VIZCAYA SA</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +3/16     PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.37    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    100.37    PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/ES</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
